# Key material stays out. The exceptions are the .pem files under the fixture
# and test-vector directories. A key file of another kind there, or a fixture
# directory somewhere else, needs its own line here or is silently left out.
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
!test-vectors/**/*.pem
!tests/fixtures/**/*.pem
!packages/*/tests/fixtures/**/*.pem
